                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 67,
                "retweet_count": 64,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "We know Medicaid saves lives. Approximately 21,000 Virgin Islanders rely on this critical program for their healthcare needs. Republicans are pushing a nearly $1 trillion Medicaid cut that will force Virgin Islanders and millions of Americans into a place of no access to health care. I am fighting back to save Medicaid and protect the most vulnerable among us.",
