                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "In honor of Virgin Islands History Month and Women's History Month, today we present Dr. Marcella Nu\u00f1ez-Smith, who served as Senior Advisor to the White House COVID-19 Response and Chair of the Presidential COVID-19 Health Equity Task Force at the Department of Health and Human Services.\n\nDr. Nu\u00f1ez works to address disparities, particularly among marginalized communities and is a strong advocate for improving medical access in the Caribbean. \n\nPhoto Credit: New York Times",
